{"id":"6c59f4db569f49e9","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-T-closure.md","title":"添加真理层的最小句法闭包","display":"df-T-closure — 添加真理层的最小句法闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-T-closure","aliases":["91-df-T-closure","91-df-truth-closure"],"display":"df-T-closure — 添加真理层的最小句法闭包","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-iteration]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-T-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-T-closure</span><span>91-df-truth-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-T-closure — 添加真理层的最小句法闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebf36f4bba071548\" href=\"?note=ebf36f4bba071548\" title=\"91-df-truth-iteration\">91-df-truth-iteration</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{It}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{It}_T\\)</span> 为自然数真理句法迭代；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_T,\\operatorname{TCl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_T,\\operatorname{TCl}\\)</span> 为下述性质和算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}T\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Closed}_T(\\Psi)\\coloneqq\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Psi\\;\\operatorname{It}_T(1,\\varphi)\\in\\Psi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}T\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Closed}_T(\\Psi)\\coloneqq\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Psi\\;\\operatorname{It}_T(1,\\varphi)\\in\\Psi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:\\Phi\\subseteq\\Psi,\\operatorname{Closed}_T(\\Psi)\\}\n=\\{\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:\\Phi\\subseteq\\Psi,\\operatorname{Closed}_T(\\Psi)\\}\n=\\{\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>等号右边包含原集且添一层封闭；任何封闭超集通过 n 上的归纳包含它，因此交集刻画良定义并等于显式生成集。\n这里的成员是句法句子，J 固定点的成员是代码，二者需通过编码映射连接。由真理原子子句才能证明一个固定点的解码句子集 T 闭合，不能仅由“极小”推出。\n句法 T 闭包不等于证明闭包、组合真理或真理归纳；它不承担任何语义真值或算术强度保证。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 13.9 的真理迭代记号；本地句法闭包的显式生成推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"ebf36f4bba071548","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-iteration]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{It}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Closed}_T,\\operatorname{TCl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}T\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Closed}_T(\\Psi)\\coloneqq\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Psi\\;\\operatorname{It}_T(1,\\varphi)\\in\\Psi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:\\Phi\\subseteq\\Psi,\\operatorname{Closed}_T(\\Psi)\\}\n=\\{\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1548,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-T-closure]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-iterative-construction.md]]\n[[91-df-jump-operator.md]